:: i4 [i4 cedar-oasis map]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <p>Welcome to Cedar Oasis!</p>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Look around->i4: description]]</li>
      <li>[[Try some street food.->i4: street food]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'i4'>><<n>><<e>><<w>><<s>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'i4'>>
</div>

:: i4: description [i4 cedar-oasis description]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <img class='concept' src='images/story/cedar-oasis.png'>
  <div>
    <p>Cedar Oasis sits along the Great River in the southern end of the Shin Gobee Desert. The architecture is a mix of large glass domes and smaller, clay and stone buildings.</p>
    <p>For an arid biome, there certainly are a lot of plants around. You wonder how they're able to supply water to everything.</p>
    <p>A welcome sign explains that there are three main districts: The Market (south), The Archives (southeast), and The Canyon (east).</p>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Keep exploring this amazing place.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>